The implementation in this repository is a native Kotlin/Android port of the
established weekssa/opra-uapp-converter behavior and has been substantially
rewritten for local OPRA catalog ingestion, validation, Room-managed user state,
background reconciliation, Android Storage Access Framework export, and native
app UX.

